    {
      "type": "kit-text-block",
      "data": {
        "title": "01\nTHE *problem*",
        "heading_level": "2",
        "body": "The old site ran on Astro with a separate Bun CMS: two codebases for one small site, and every publish rebuilt the whole thing. It also sold only AI implementation, though most of my work is Laravel and WordPress.",
        "background": "tinted"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "kit-text-block",
      "data": {
        "title": "02\nWHAT *changed*",
        "heading_level": "2",
        "body": "One Laravel app on cg-cms, with pages cached to disk and served by nginx. The fonts are self-hosted and there's one stylesheet, so lab LCP went from about 3 seconds to under 2. More than 500 automated tests cover it, and every article stayed.",
        "background": "tinted"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "kit-stats",
      "data": {
        "tone": "tinted",
        "stats": [
          {
            "value": "79",
            "label": "Live URLs, all kept"
          },
          {
            "value": "Under 2 s",
            "label": "LCP in lab tests, down from about 3 s"
          },
          {
            "value": "500+",
            "label": "Automated tests"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "kit-text-block",
      "data": {
        "eyebrow": "03 · The hard part",
        "title": "79 URLS, *no broken links.*",
        "title_size": "large",
        "heading_level": "2",
        "body": "Before the switch I listed all 79 live URLs, and a check of every one runs before each deploy, so nothing indexed broke on the way. Every article stayed, because the writing brings the search traffic.",
        "background": "plain"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "kit-text-block",
      "data": {
        "title": "04\nFOR *clients*",
        "heading_level": "2",
        "body": "A rebuild can change everything underneath, as long as nothing indexed breaks on the way. A rebuild I do keeps every URL that has traffic or links.",
        "background": "tinted",
        "link_label": "Start a rebuild",
        "link_url": "/start"
      }
